Z||000002||avengador1||11-30-2001||08:02 PM||||Get a lawyer and go to court and arrange to pay support, file for joint custody. She won't be able to deny your parental rights, you can even arrange to have it deducted directly from your paycheck. Ask the judge if you can have copies made of the pictures or video, I'm sure they won't deny a reasonable request like that, especially if you are willing to show responsability. Don't be mean and keep your cool in front of the judge. Be respectfull to him/her. Hope this helps<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by avengador1 (edited 11-30-2001).]||||reg||1
